    stock offered by the selling stockholder</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 2%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 68%"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">1,162,790
    shares</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
